## 🧠 The Core Question

> **Do you WANT full automation?**

### Option A: Full Automation (Hard)
- Build a daemon that:
  - Polls [events.jsonl](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.brain/ledger/events.jsonl)
  - Matches to [triggers.json](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.brain/ledger/triggers.json)
  - Spawns Claude API calls for each agent
  - Collects responses
- **Cost:** ~$5-20/day in API calls
- **Risk:** Runaway loops, hallucination at scale
- **Benefit:** True "set it and forget it"

### Option B: Human-in-Loop (Current + Improved)
- Keep manual thread activation
- But: Use Nucleus MCP to auto-load context
- Focus on **"Tech Director" single thread** model
- **Cost:** $0 extra
- **Risk:** Lower (you're always in control)
- **Benefit:** You learn before you automate

---

## ✅ Recommendations

| Priority | Action | Effort |
|:---------|:-------|:-------|
| **1** | Adopt "Tech Director" single-thread model | 0 effort |
| **2** | Use Nucleus MCP to check state before work | 1 line |
| **3** | Deprecate multi-thread agent windows | Delete threads |
| **4** | (Later) Build flywheel daemon when you have revenue | Big |

